{"id": "biz-3", "headline": "Smart knee implants raise costs, patient concerns", "source": "KFF Health News", "url": "https://kffhealthnews.org/health-industry/smart-joint-implants-knees-health-costs-patients-surprised/", "published": "2026-11-23", "url_verified": true, "pages": ["KFF Health News reports that \"smart\" joint implants are driving up costs, sometimes without patients asking for them. Steve Russak, 70, of California, woke from knee surgery to texts from Zimmer Biomet and learned he had received a Persona IQ knee with a battery, sensors and a transmitter. He is suing the doctor, Zimmer and Canary Medical, claiming he should have been able to decline the device or opt out of data collection. He also cited an MRI compatibility problem. Zimmer and Canary deny the allegations. The next hearing is set for December. Source: KFF Health News."], "qr": {"n": 37, "rows": ["1111111000101000111100010100001111111", "1000001010100011100011000011001000001", "1011101000001011000101110011001011101", "1011101011101110010010111110001011101", "1011101001000100111110010100101011101", "1000001011011111001010101001001000001", "1111111010101010101010101010101111111", "0000000001110001101011011011100000000", "1111101111011111110000111111110101010", "1011100101101010101111110100100101110", "1110101111001011100011100111011011101", "0100000111101001000011000001111111010", "1001101011101111010000011110011011101", "1101110010101010101110011000110100110", "0000101111000101001001101011111000111", "0111100100110011000111100001010011001", "0101001110111101110100100111011011101", "0000100001111100111110010010110100110", "0111111011101011100011001011101000111", "1011010010100011101101111011110100001", "1110111000101110010100100111001111111", "1101100011010010000110010010100101110", "0101111110000101100011100101010000111", "0111010010000010001011101011000110001", "0110111001001111110100101110011011111", "1111010000010010111101110010100100010", "1010101011000011001011000011110101111", "1001